          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "EZK 23:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you will tear your breasts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "EZK 23:34"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I have spoken, declares the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.23.34"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Therefore this is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.23.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: Since you have forgotten me and turned your back on me, you must bear the consequences of your lewdness and prostitution.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.23.36"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me: \"Son of man, will you judge Oholah and Oholibah? Then confront them with their detestable practices,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for they have committed adultery and blood is on their hands. They committed adultery with their idols; they even sacrificed their children, whom they bore to me, as food for them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have also done this to me: At that same time they defiled my sanctuary and desecrated my Sabbaths.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the very day they sacrificed their children to their idols, they entered my sanctuary and desecrated it. That is what they did in my house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"They even sent messengers for men who came from far away, and when they arrived you bathed yourself for them, applied eye makeup and put on your jewelry.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You sat on an elegant couch, with a table spread before it on which you had placed the incense and olive oil that belonged to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The noise of a carefree crowd was around her; drunkards were brought from the desert along with men from the rabble, and they put bracelets on the wrists of the woman and her sister and beautiful crowns on their heads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I said about the one worn out by adultery, 'Now let them use her as a prostitute, for that is all she is.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they slept with her. As men sleep with a prostitute, so they slept with those lewd women, Oholah and Oholibah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But righteous judges will sentence them to the punishment of women who commit adultery and shed blood, because they are adulterous and blood is on their hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.23.46",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.23.46"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: Bring a mob against them and give them over to terror and plunder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The mob will stone them and cut them down with their swords; they will kill their sons and daughters and burn down their houses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"So I will put an end to lewdness in the land, that all women may take warning and not imitate you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will suffer the penalty for your lewdness and bear the consequences of your sins of idolatry. Then you will know that I am the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.23.49",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.23.49"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
